WEBVTT

00:00:15.159 --> 00:00:16.799
Repeat, disengage.

00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:18.159
Friendlies...
No!

00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:19.679
Call off the missiles.
I'll do anything.

00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:23.079
Too late.
Fifteen years too late.

00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:27.999
Friendlies two-zero miles
south-southwest
of your position.

00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:30.399
Angels 10. Track east.
Disengage.

00:00:30.479 --> 00:00:32.999
Vi! Put a force field
around the plane.

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:34.839
You said not to
use our powers.

00:00:34.919 --> 00:00:37.399
I know what I said.
Listen to what I'm
saying now!

00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:39.559
Disengage.
Repeat, disengage!

00:00:44.199 --> 00:00:45.399
Mom?

00:00:45.959 --> 00:00:46.999
HELEN: Violet!

00:00:47.159 --> 00:00:50.519
Mayday. India Golf
niner-niner is
buddy-spiked. Abort!

00:00:50.599 --> 00:00:51.999
There are children aboard.

00:00:52.079 --> 00:00:53.879
HELEN: There are
children aboard!
No!

00:00:55.719 --> 00:00:57.199
Put a field
around us now!

00:00:57.279 --> 00:00:58.679
I've never done
one that big.

00:00:58.759 --> 00:00:59.879
Do it now!

00:01:01.439 --> 00:01:02.799
Abort, abort, abort!

00:01:05.279 --> 00:01:06.759
Abort, abort, abort!

00:01:20.959 --> 00:01:22.759
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:39.679
Brace yourselves!

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.079
KIDS: Mom!

00:01:47.159 --> 00:01:49.039
Everybody calm down.

00:01:49.119 --> 00:01:50.839
I'll tell you what
we're not gonna do.

00:01:50.919 --> 00:01:53.479
We're not gonna panic,
we're not... Look out!

00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:07.439
Oh, my God!
Whose idea was this?
What are we gonna do?

00:02:07.519 --> 00:02:09.999
We're dead!
We're dead!

00:02:10.079 --> 00:02:11.159
It blew up!

00:02:11.319 --> 00:02:12.959
We survived
but we're dead!

00:02:13.039 --> 00:02:14.439
Stop it!

00:02:15.159 --> 00:02:16.759
We are not gonna die!

00:02:16.839 --> 00:02:18.799
Both of you
will get a grip.

00:02:18.879 --> 00:02:21.359
Or so help me
I will ground you
for a month!

00:02:21.519 --> 00:02:22.879
Understand?

00:02:24.199 --> 00:02:27.879
We have a confirmed hit.
Target was destroyed.

00:02:28.039 --> 00:02:29.999
Ah, you'll get over it.

00:02:30.279 --> 00:02:33.639
I seem to recall
you prefer to
"work alone."

00:02:33.799 --> 00:02:35.479
(EVIL LAUGHTER)

00:02:43.759 --> 00:02:45.759
Release me. Now!

00:02:46.359 --> 00:02:47.279
Or what?

00:02:47.399 --> 00:02:48.959
I'll crush her.

00:02:49.039 --> 00:02:51.919
That sounds
a little dark for you.
Well, go ahead.

00:02:51.999 --> 00:02:54.879
It'll be easy.
Like breaking
a toothpick.

00:02:55.239 --> 00:02:56.919
(LAUGHING) Show me.

00:03:09.559 --> 00:03:11.559
SYNDROME: I knew
you couldn't do it.

00:03:11.679 --> 00:03:14.399
Even when you have
nothing to lose.

00:03:14.679 --> 00:03:15.959
You're weak.

00:03:16.919 --> 00:03:18.759
And I've outgrown you.

00:03:21.039 --> 00:03:22.479
(BOB SOBBING)

00:03:28.679 --> 00:03:32.439
Those were
short-range missiles.
Land-based.

00:03:32.999 --> 00:03:34.439
That way is
our best bet.

00:03:34.559 --> 00:03:37.359
You want to go
toward the people
that tried to kill us?

00:03:37.439 --> 00:03:39.759
If it means land, yes.

00:03:39.839 --> 00:03:41.439
Do you expect us
to swim there?

00:03:41.519 --> 00:03:44.279
I expect you
to trust me.

